Quiet Hours is a reading queue with a deliberate ending. Articles are grouped
into small sessions, typography stays adjustable, and unfinished reading can
wait without generating reminders.

= A nested project route

This entry also demonstrates that an Aster content id can contain folders. The
spread route keeps `nested/quiet-hours` intact from collection entry to URL.
